<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Features | AI Resume Analyzer</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/features.css" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="features-container">
      <section class="hero">
        <h1>Features of AI Resume Analyzer</h1>
        <p>
          Discover the powerful AI-driven features that help you create a
          professional, ATS-friendly resume and improve your chances of getting
          hired.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="feature-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>📄 Resume Upload</h2>
          <p>
            Upload your resume in PDF or DOCX format securely for instant AI
            analysis.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>🤖 AI Resume Analysis</h2>
          <p>
            Analyze your resume using AI and receive detailed, personalized
            feedback.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>📊 ATS Score</h2>
          <p>
            Check how well your resume performs with Applicant Tracking Systems
            used by recruiters.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>💡 Smart Suggestions</h2>
          <p>
            Receive recommendations to improve formatting, wording, grammar, and
            overall resume quality.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>🛠️ Skill Gap Detection</h2>
          <p>
            Identify missing technical and soft skills based on your resume
            content.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>🎯 Job Match Analysis</h2>
          <p>
            Compare your resume with a job description to determine how well it
            matches the role.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>📈 Resume History</h2>
          <p>
            View and manage previously uploaded resumes and analysis reports.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>🔒 Secure Storage</h2>
          <p>Store your resumes securely so you can access them anytime.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-card">
          <h2>⚡ Fast Processing</h2>
          <p>Get comprehensive resume analysis within seconds using AI.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <div class="buttons">
        <a href="/analyze">
          <button>Analyze Resume</button>
        </a>

        <a href="/">
          <button>Back to Home</button>
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
